Package: MRMOSS
Type: Package
Title: Scalable Joint Mendelian Randomization of Correlated Outcomes Using Summary Statistics
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-10-14
Authors@R: person("Yunlong", "Cao", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "157203291+YunlongCao@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Fits the MR-MOSS model, which relates one exposure to many
    correlated outcomes using GWAS summary statistics, and provides likelihood
    ratio tests for the causal effect on each outcome, on prespecified sets of
    outcomes and on all outcomes together.
